**Platform auto-detection logic** (run on every URL change):

```js
function detectPlatform(url) {
  if (url.includes('facebook.com')) return 'facebook';
  if (url.includes('instagram.com')) return 'instagram';
  if (url.includes('wa.me') || url.includes('whatsapp')) return 'whatsapp';
  if (url.includes('tiktok.com')) return 'tiktok';
  if (url.includes('youtube.com')) return 'youtube';
  if (url.includes('linkedin.com')) return 'linkedin';
  if (url.includes('twitter.com') || url.includes('x.com')) return 'twitter';
  return 'link';
}
```

Each platform maps to a distinct icon and a distinct background color pill (facebook → blue, instagram → amber, whatsapp → green, tiktok → gray, generic → gray).

**Save behavior:** Write the full `Links` array back to `Footer.Links`. Slogan fields are written to their respective columns in the same upsert. Toast: "Footer saved."

