**`BilingualField`**

Props: `labelEn`, `labelAr`, `valueEn`, `valueAr`, `onChangeEn`, `onChangeAr`, `multiline` (bool), `rows` (number, default 3).

Renders a two-column grid. Left cell: label with EN badge, input/textarea. Right cell: label with AR badge, input/textarea with `dir="rtl"`. Both cells have identical heights. The EN badge is `background: #E6F1FB; color: #0C447C`. The AR badge is `background: #FAEEDA; color: #633806`.

**`SectionCard`**

Props: `title`, `subtitle`, `saveLabel`, `onSave`, `onDiscard` (optional), `saving` (bool), `children`.

Renders a section block with a header row (title + subtitle on the left, buttons on the right). The save button shows a spinner icon when `saving` is true and is disabled during that state. If `onDiscard` is provided, a ghost "Discard" button appears to the left of the save button.

**`ColorPickerField`**

Props: `value`, `onChange`, `label`, `hint`.

Renders a label, then a flex row containing: a 32×32 div acting as the color swatch (background set to `value`), clicking it triggers a hidden `<input type="color">` overlaid on the swatch, and a text input next to it showing the hex value. Both the color picker and the text input update the same state. Sanitize the text input: accept only valid 3- or 6-digit hex strings (with or without `#`), normalize to 6-digit uppercase on blur.

**`LogoUploader`**

Props: `currentUrl`, `onUpload`, `uploading`.

Renders a 64×32 logo preview box (or a placeholder with the text "No logo" if `currentUrl` is null), beside a dashed upload zone. The upload zone accepts only PNG, SVG, and WEBP files up to 2 MB. Validate file type and size before uploading. If invalid, show an inline error. During upload (`uploading: true`), show a spinner over the upload zone and disable it.

**`SocialLinkRow`**

Props: `platform`, `url`, `onChange`, `onRemove`.

The platform icon is an inline SVG rendered by a `getPlatformIcon(platform)` helper. Each platform has a fixed background color for the icon pill. The URL is shown as a monospace string that becomes an editable input on click (click-to-edit pattern). On blur, run `detectPlatform` and update the platform prop accordingly.

**`NavItemRow`**

Props: `id`, `link`, `labelEn`, `labelAr`, `onChangeLabelEn`, `onChangeLabelAr`, `onRemove`.

Wrapped in `@dnd-kit/sortable`'s `useSortable` hook. The drag handle uses `attributes` and `listeners` from `useSortable`. The row has a subtle left border highlight when actively being dragged.

