### Toast system

Use a lightweight context-based toast system (not a third-party library unless one is already in the codebase). The toast renders in the bottom-right corner, slides up with a CSS transition, auto-dismisses after 2.5 seconds. Three variants: `success` (green left border), `error` (red left border), `info` (blue left border). Maximum one toast visible at a time; new toasts replace the current one.

